00:12:08.000 --> 00:13:20.000
However, they soon realized this was a mistake. Forensic examination of Hannah's body revealed fragments of blonde hair in her hand. This was significant given that Chris was blonde whereas David's hair was brown. A subsequent inspection of the hotel room David and Chris had shared also revealed there was dried blood on a pair of David's pants. Police began to wonder whether David and Chris could have been involved in some kind of love triangle that went violently awry. Two days after Hannah and David's bodies were found, Chris Ware and his older brother James were stopped for further questioning at Bangkok International Airport as they attempted to leave the country. James had spent time with David and Chris on Katow but had left the island the night before the murders had occurred. Regardless, police ordered the brothers to stay in Thailand until the results of DNA testing came back.
然而，他们很快意识到这是一个错误。对汉娜尸体的法医检查显示，她手中残留着金发碎片。考虑到克里斯是金发，而大卫的头发是棕色，这一点很重要。随后对大卫和克里斯共用的酒店房间的检查也发现，大卫的一条裤子上有干涸的血迹。警方开始怀疑大卫和克里斯是否卷入了某种演变成暴力的三角恋。在汉娜和大卫的尸体被发现两天后，克里斯·韦尔和他的哥哥詹姆斯在试图离开泰国时，在曼谷国际机场被拦下接受进一步询问。詹姆斯曾在涛岛与大卫和克里斯待在一起，但在谋杀案发生的前一天晚上离开了该岛。无论如何，警方命令这对兄弟留在泰国，直到DNA检测结果出来。

