00:13:20.000 --> 00:14:53.000
News of the murders made international headlines creating a public relations nightmare for Thailand where tourism accounts for 10% of the economy. Roughly 20 million tourists visit the country each year but those numbers had recently been under threat. In May of 2014, a military coup had overthrown the democratically elected government and Thailand had since been under martial law. The political instability combined with the fact that most travel insurance companies excluded cover for destinations where martial law is in place meant the number of foreigners visiting Thailand had been decreasing. With the brutal killer or killers targeting holiday makers now on the loose, the pressure was on for authorities to make an arrest and fast. Adding to the pressure was the fact that the neighbouring island of Kop Pen Yang had developed an unsavory reputation that threatened to tarnish Katow standing as a peaceful, relaxing tourist destination. Famous for its monthly full moon parties which attracted upwards of 30,000 young revelers, Kop Pen Yang had become notorious for drugs, sexual assaults and robberies. Many locals believed the same criminals who preyed on tourists on Kop Pen Yang were taking advantage of Katow's growing party scene.
谋杀案的消息登上了国际头条，给泰国造成了公关噩梦，旅游业占该国经济的10%。每年约有2000万游客访问泰国，但这些数字最近受到了威胁。2014年5月，一场军事政变推翻了民选政府，此后泰国一直处于戒严状态。政治不稳定，加上大多数旅游保险公司将戒严地区排除在承保范围之外，意味着访问泰国的外国人数量一直在减少。随着残忍的杀手现在逍遥法外，当局面临着迅速逮捕凶手的压力。增加压力的是，邻近的帕岸岛因其臭名昭著的声誉而威胁到涛岛作为和平、放松的旅游目的地的地位。帕岸岛以其每月一次的满月派对而闻名，吸引了超过3万名年轻狂欢者，因毒品、性侵犯和抢劫而臭名昭著。许多当地人认为，在帕岸岛上掠夺游客的罪犯正在利用涛岛日益增长的派对场景。

14
00:14:53.000 --> 00:16:10.000
Thailand's self-appointed Prime Minister, Army Chief General Pray Utan Orsha appeared on television to address the issue of tourist safety. Commenting, Tourists think our country is beautiful and safe so they can do whatever they want, they can wear bikinis and walk everywhere. He then added that only tourists who were, quote, not beautiful should feel safe in bikinis, a comment that sparked international outrage and required the general to issue a public apology. Within days, 60 police officers had descended on Katow to expedite the investigation. Upon inspecting the crime scene, the island's most senior police officer concluded one thing, there was no way the murders were committed by a Thai person. He believed Thai's simply weren't capable of carrying out such a horrendous act of violence. Instead, police focused their attention on foreigners. Yet, the semen staining found on Hannah Witheridge's body was determined to have come from two Asian males.
泰国自封的总理、陆军总司令巴育·占奥差将军在电视上发表讲话，讨论游客安全问题。他评论道：“游客认为我们的国家美丽安全，所以他们可以为所欲为，他们可以穿比基尼到处走。”他随后补充说，只有“不漂亮”的游客在穿比基尼时才应该感到安全，这一言论引发了国际公愤，并要求将军发表公开道歉。几天之内，60名警察抵达涛岛以加快调查速度。在检查犯罪现场后，岛上最高级别的警官得出一个结论：谋杀案绝不可能是泰国人所为。他认为泰国人根本没有能力做出如此可怕的暴力行为。相反，警方将注意力集中在外国人身上。然而，在汉娜·威瑟里奇尸体上发现的精液污渍被确定来自两名亚洲男性。

